'''Necromancer [[Ascalon armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as starter armor (named '''Initiate's''') and is also available in the Factions campaign.

'''Note:''' Necromancer Ascalon armor art does not have headgear, but the [[Necromancer Ragged Scar Pattern]] art is available from the same armorer in Factions. Pictures and crafting details are available on that page.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of this armor.

